flowchart LR
  S[Sender-controlled output bytes] --> N[Node: shape and spend validity]
  N --> C[Chain: unversioned delivery context]
  C --> V[Wallet: current-v2 attempt]
  V -->|miss| L[Legacy T0 and bounded T search]
  V --> O[AEAD and spend ownership checks]
  L --> O
  O -->|owned| R[Recognized wallet receipt]
  O -->|not owned or invalid| D[No credit]
